t-term investments","dcf_model_ev":1457,"ev_to_ebitda":200.9,"debt_to_ebitda":27.07,"net_debt_to_ebitda":23.18,"f_score":4,"f_score_breakdown":[{"id":1,"category":"盈利能力","desc":"資產回報率 ROA > 0","passed":1,"detail":"當期 ROA = 0.5%"},{"id":2,"category":"盈利能力","desc":"營業現金流 CFO > 0","passed":1,"detail":"自由現金流 = $58M"},{"id":3,"category":"盈利能力","desc":"資產回報率持續擴張 (ΔROA > 0)","passed":0,"detail":"回報率穩步領先同業基準"},{"id":4,"category":"盈利能力","desc":"應計利潤品質高 (CFO > 淨利潤)","passed":1,"detail":"真實現金流充沛，無虛報帳面獲利"},{"id":5,"category":"槓桿與償債","desc":"財務槓桿未惡化 (ΔLeverage ≤ 0)","passed":0,"detail":"總負債資產比率 = 117.1%"},{"id":6,"category":"槓桿與償債","desc":"短期流動性安全 (ΔLiquidity > 0)","passed":0,"detail":"流動比率 = 0.50"},{"id":7,"category":"槓桿與償債","desc":"股本未遭稀釋 (ΔShares ≤ 0)","passed":1,"detail":"未大幅增發新股割韭菜"},{"id":8,"category":"營運效率","desc":"毛利率擴張 (ΔMargin > 0)","passed":0,"detail":"產品定價權增強，毛利結構健康"},{"id":9,"category":"營運效率","desc":"資產週轉率提升 (ΔTurnover > 0)","passed":0,"detail":"每單位資產產出效益改善"}],"fair_val":19.81,"default_fair_val":19.81,"premium_pct":1471,"is_undervalued":false,"pe_trailing":967.4,"pe_forward":851.3,"pb_trailing":-28.5,"pb_forward":-25.7,"div_yield":0.01,"ps_ratio":32.5,"fcf_to_ev":0.68,"fcf_to_mcap":0.77,"liab_to_assets":117.1,"cash_to_assets":10.7,"current_ratio":0.5,"roe":-2.9,"roa":0.5,"moat":{"ticker":"MSGK","period":"2026Q4","m1_brand_pricing":{"score":6,"comment_zh":"MSGK 的品牌定價權相對有限。雖然其名稱與紐約尼克隊緊密相連，具有一定的粉絲基礎和情感價值，但這主要體現在門票銷售和周邊商品上，而非核心的媒體內容服務。在媒體內容領域，其內容的獨特性和不可替代性不足以支撐顯著的定價權。面對眾多競爭對手，其內容的議價能力受到限制，難以大幅度提高訂閱費用或廣告收入。品牌價值更多是情感連結，而非強勢的商業定價壁壘。","comment_en":"MSGK's brand pricing power is relatively limited. While its name is closely associated with the New York Knicks, possessing a certain fan base and emotional value, this is primarily reflected in ticket sales and merchandise rather than core media content services. In the media content domain, the uniqueness and irreplaceability of its content are insufficient to support significant pricing power. Facing numerous competitors, its content's bargaining power is constrained, making it difficult to substantially increase subscription fees or advertising revenue. The brand value is more of an emotional connection than a strong commercial pricing barrier."},"m2_patents_regulatory":{"score":1,"comment_zh":"MSGK 在專利和監管壁壘方面幾乎沒有優勢。作為一家媒體和娛樂公司，其核心業務不依賴於技術專利，也不受特定行業的嚴格監管保護。內容的生產和分發相對開放，進入門檻較低。與製藥或高科技行業不同，其商業模式不具備由專利或特許經營權構成的顯著護城河。這意味著其業務容易受到新進入者和替代品的衝擊，缺乏監管帶來的穩定性。","comment_en":"MSGK has virtually no advantage in terms of patents and regulatory barriers. As a media and entertainment company, its core business does not rely on technological patents, nor is it protected by strict industry-specific regulations. Content production and distribution are relatively open, with low barriers to entry. Unlike pharmaceutical or high-tech industries, its business model does not possess a significant moat formed by patents or exclusive licenses. This implies its operations are susceptible to impacts from new entrants and substitutes, lacking the stability provided by regulation."},"m3_high_switching_costs":{"score":3,"comment_zh":"MSGK 的客戶轉換成本非常低。對於觀眾而言，觀看 MSG 的比賽或節目，只需購買門票或訂閱服務，沒有複雜的設置或長期承諾。一旦有更具吸引力或更便宜的替代品出現，觀眾很容易轉向。對於廣告商而言，轉換成本也相對較低，他們可以輕易地將廣告預算轉移到其他媒體平台。這種低轉換成本使得公司難以鎖定客戶，並在定價上處於劣勢。","comment_en":"MSGK's customer switching costs are very low. For viewers, watching MSG's games or shows simply requires purchasing tickets or subscribing to a service, with no complex setup or long-term commitment. Viewers can easily switch to more attractive or cheaper alternatives if they appear. For advertisers, switching costs are also relatively low, as they can easily shift their advertising budgets to other media platforms. These low switching costs make it difficult for the company to lock in customers and place it at a disadvantage in terms of pricing."},"m4_network_effects":{"score":2,"comment_zh":"MSGK 的網絡效應非常微弱。其核心業務是體育賽事和現場娛樂，雖然觀眾的參與和討論能形成一定的社群效應，但這並非典型的、能自我強化的網絡效應。例如，更多的觀眾並不會直接增加比賽本身的觀賞價值，也不會讓球隊表現更好。與社交媒體或電商平台不同，其用戶數量增長並不能直接帶來邊際效益的提升，因此網絡效應並非其主要的護城河。","comment_en":"MSGK's network effects are very weak. Its core business involves sports events and live entertainment. While audience participation and discussion can create a certain community effect, this is not a typical self-reinforcing network effect. For instance, more viewers do not directly increase the viewing value of the game itself, nor do they improve the team's performance. Unlike social media or e-commerce platforms, an increase in user numbers does not directly lead to improved marginal benefits, thus network effects are not its primary moat."},"m5_cost_advantage_scale":{"score":5,"comment_zh":"MSGK 在規模成本方面具有一定的優勢，但並非壓倒性。作為紐約地區主要的體育和娛樂場所運營商，其擁有標誌性的場館，這帶來了一定的固定成本攤銷優勢。在採購、營銷和管理方面，其規模效應能帶來一定的成本節約。然而，體育和娛樂行業的競爭激烈，內容成本（如球員薪資、賽事版權）高昂，且場館運營的邊際成本不低。因此，規模優勢相對有限，不足以形成絕對的成本領先。","comment_en":"MSGK possesses some advantages in economies of scale, but they are not overwhelming. As a major operator of sports and entertainment venues in the New York area, it owns iconic arenas, which provide some advantage in spreading fixed costs. In procurement, marketing, and management, its scale can lead to certain cost savings. However, the sports and entertainment industry is highly competitive, content costs (such as player salaries, broadcast rights) are high, and the marginal costs of venue operations are not insignificant. Therefore, the scale advantage is relatively limited and insufficient to form an absolute cost leadership."},"m6_unique_geography_assets":{"score":8,"comment_zh":"MSGK 擁有獨特的地理資產，這是其重要的護城河。麥迪遜廣場花園（Madison Square Garden）是世界聞名的體育和娛樂中心，位於紐約市中心，地理位置極佳。這種獨特的地理位置和標誌性的場館，使其成為舉辦頂級體育賽事（如 NBA、NHL）和大型演出的首選地點。這種稀缺性使得競爭對手難以複製，並為公司帶來了穩定的租金收入和活動舉辦機會，形成了一種基於地點的壟斷優勢。","comment_en":"MSGK owns unique geographical assets, which constitute a significant moat. Madison Square Garden is a world-renowned sports and entertainment hub, strategically located in the heart of New York City. This prime location and iconic venue make it a preferred destination for top-tier sporting events (like NBA, NHL) and major performances. This scarcity makes it difficult for competitors to replicate, bringing the company stable rental income and event hosting opportunities, forming a location-based monopolistic advantage."},"m7_operational_efficiency":{"score":6,"comment_zh":"MSGK 在營運效率方面表現尚可，但並非頂尖。作為一家擁有大型場館的公司，其在活動策劃、場館管理、票務銷售和後勤保障等方面需要高度的營運效率來維持盈利能力。其長期運營經驗應使其在這些方面具備一定的優勢。然而，體育和娛樂行業的利潤率普遍不高，且受賽事結果、觀眾興趣波動等外部因素影響較大。要達到巴菲特所欣賞的極高營運效率，仍有提升空間。","comment_en":"MSGK performs adequately in operational efficiency, but it is not top-tier. As a company operating large venues, it requires a high degree of operational efficiency in event planning, venue management, ticket sales, and logistical support to maintain profitability. Its long-term operating experience should provide it with certain advantages in these areas. However, profit margins in the sports and entertainment industry are generally not high and are significantly affected by external factors such as game outcomes and fluctuations in audience interest. There is still room for improvement to reach the exceptionally high operational efficiency that Buffett admires."},"m8_capital_allocation":{"score":5,"comment_zh":"MSGK 的資本配置能力有待觀察。公司財務狀況顯示現金相對較少，負債較高，這限制了其進行大規模投資或股票回購的能力。其過去的資本配置決策，例如對場館的投資和維護，以及對內容的投入，其回報率（ROE -2.9%）並不理想。巴菲特高度重視管理層的資本配置能力，而目前來看，MSGK 在有效利用資本、創造長期股東價值方面，表現並不出色，甚至可能存在隱憂。","comment_en":"MSGK's capital allocation capability remains to be observed. The company's financial situation shows relatively low cash and high debt, limiting its ability to undertake large-scale investments or share buybacks. Its past capital allocation decisions, such as investments in and maintenance of venues, as well as content投入, have not yielded ideal returns (ROE -2.9%). Buffett places great importance on management's capital allocation skills, and currently, MSGK's performance in effectively utilizing capital and creating long-term shareholder value is not outstanding and may even harbor concerns."},"m9_customer_retention":{"score":7,"comment_zh":"MSGK 在客戶保留方面具有一定的實力，主要體現在其忠實的粉絲群體。紐約尼克隊和紐約遊騎兵隊擁有悠久的歷史和龐大的忠實粉絲基礎，這些粉絲對球隊有深厚的情感連結，會持續購買門票、周邊商品，並關注球隊動態。這種忠誠度使得球隊即使在表現不佳時，也能維持一定的觀眾基礎。然而，這種忠誠度更多是基於情感而非商業合約，因此並非絕對的保留，仍需不斷努力維繫。","comment_en":"MSGK has a certain strength in customer retention, primarily reflected in its loyal fan base. The New York Knicks and New York Rangers have long histories and large, dedicated fan bases. These fans have deep emotional connections to the teams, continuously purchasing tickets, merchandise, and following team developments. This loyalty allows the teams to maintain a certain audience base even during periods of underperformance. However, this loyalty is based more on emotion than commercial contracts, thus it is not absolute retention and requires continuous effort to maintain."},"m10_durability":{"score":6,"comment_zh":"MSGK 的業務持久性面臨挑戰。雖然其標誌性的場館和部分體育隊伍具有長期的吸引力，但媒體和娛樂行業變化迅速。新興的流媒體服務、不斷變化的觀眾口味以及體育賽事版權的競爭，都可能對其傳統的商業模式構成威脅。其核心資產（如麥迪遜廣場花園）的物理存在提供了某種程度的穩定性，但內容的吸引力、觀眾的參與方式以及競爭格局的演變，都將影響其長期持久性。其持久性不如那些擁有強大品牌、網絡效應或專利壁壘的企業。","comment_en":"MSGK's business durability faces challenges. While its iconic venues and some sports teams possess long-term appeal, the media and entertainment industry is rapidly evolving. Emerging streaming services, changing audience preferences, and competition for sports broadcasting rights could threaten its traditional business model. The physical existence of its core assets (like Madison Square Garden) provides a degree of stability, but the appeal of its content, how audiences engage, and the evolution of the competitive landscape will all impact its long-term durability. Its durability is less robust than companies with strong brands, network effects, or patent barriers."},"overall_moat_verdict_zh":"MSGK 的護城河主要建立在其獨特的地理資產——麥迪遜廣場花園——以及紐約尼克隊和遊騎兵隊的忠實粉絲基礎之上。這兩者構成了其最主要的競爭壁壘，提供了穩定的場館使用率和觀眾流量。然而，在品牌定價權、轉換成本、網絡效應和專利監管方面，公司壁壘相對薄弱。其規模優勢有限，營運效率尚可但非頂尖，資本配置能力有待加強。整體而言，MSGK 擁有一個基於地點的收費橋模式，但其持久性和成長性面臨媒體行業快速變革的挑戰，護城河的寬度與深度均有提升空間。","overall_moat_verdict_en":"MSGK's moat is primarily built upon its unique geographical asset, Madison Square Garden, and the loyal fan base of the New York Knicks and Rangers. These two elements form its most significant competitive barriers, ensuring stable venue utilization and audience traffic. However, the company's barriers are relatively weak in terms of brand pricing power, switching costs, network effects, and patent/regulatory protection. Its scale advantages are limited, operational efficiency is adequate but not top-tier, and capital allocation capabilities require improvement. Overall, MSGK operates a location-based toll bridge model, but its durability and growth prospects face challenges from the rapid changes in the media industry, indicating room for improvement in both the width and depth of its moat.","evidenceHash":"3c6acc090ac6c53b1ddb323a685b3b5b70a272d1ce9e8c1ddb38fc983ee59245","assessmentPolicy":"buffett-moat-v3","model":"gemini-2.5-flash-lite","provider":"Vertex AI"},"ratingSources":{"moat":{"reason":null,"evidenceHash":"3c6acc090ac6c53b1ddb323a685b3b5b70a272d1ce9e8c1ddb38fc983ee59245","currentEvidenceHash":"3c6acc090ac6c53b1ddb323a685b3b5b70a272d1ce9e8c1ddb38fc983ee59245"},"fScore":{"score":4,"checkedAt":null},"zScore":{"asOfDate":"2026-06-30","period":"FY 2026","basis":"comparableAnnual","model":"z","zone":"grey","reason":null,"scoringCurrency":"USD","applicability":null,"checkedAt":"2026-11-08T07:58:01.386Z","evidenceHash":"48e00a3eadcc55bc2def1652fb571590da1fdbc676bf217a29061fc7f7bdd773"},"mScore":{"asOfDate":"2026-06-30","period":"FY 2026","basis":"comparableAnnual","model":null,"zone":"clean","reason":null,"scoringCurrency":"USD","applicability":null,"checkedAt":"2026-11-08T07:58:01.386Z","evidenceHash":"48e00a3eadcc55bc2def1652fb571590da1fdbc676bf217a29061fc7f7bdd773"}},"fin_valuation":{"is_financial":false},"image":"https://images.financialmodelingprep.com/symbol/MSGK.png","logo":"https://images.financialmodelingprep.com/symbol/MSGK.png","website":"https://www.msgknicks.com","ceo":"James Lawrence Dolan","full_time_employees":"1017","description":"MSG Knickerbockers Corp. is a sports company, which owns and operates a portfolio of assets featuring the New York Knickerbockers of the National Basketball Association and the New York Rangers of the National Hockey League. The firm’s other franchises include development league teams, such as the Hartford Wolf Pack of the American Hockey League and the Westchester Knicks of the NBA G League. The company was founded on March 4, 2015 and is headquartered in New York, NY.","description_en":"MSG Knickerbockers Corp. is a sports company, which owns and operates a portfolio of assets featuring the New York Knickerbockers of the National Basketball Association and the New York Rangers of the National Hockey League. The firm’s other franchises include development league teams, such as the Hartford Wolf Pack of the American Hockey League and the Westchester Knicks of the NBA G League. The company was founded on March 4, 2015 and is headquartered in New York, NY.","description_zh":"MSG Knickerbockers Corp. Class A（美股代碼：MSGK）為 Technology 領域之重要企業，專注於 Media & Entertainment 業務，具備清晰之商業壁壘與現金流創造能力。","address":"Two Penn Plaza","city":"New York","state":"NY","zip":"10121","country":"US","phone":null,"full_address":"Two Penn Plaza, New York, NY 10121, US","range_52w":"158.81-331.77","year_high":331.77,"year_low":158.81,"all_time_high":0,"all_time_low":158.81,"inst_ownership_pct":null,"insider_ownership_pct":null,"top_holders":[],"insider_trades":[{"date":"2026-10-28","name":"Thomas Isiah III","title":"director","is_buy":null,"action":"","shares":0,"price":0,"total_val":0},{"date":"2026-10-28","name":"Azoff Irving L.","title":"director","is_buy":null,"action":"","shares":0,"price":0,"total_val":0},{"date":"2026-10-09","name":"DiCicco Paul M.","title":"officer: EVP, CFO & Treasurer","is_buy":null,"action":"A-Award","shares":813,"price":0,"total_val":0},{"date"